@startuml sequence-vote-election-failures
' ============================================================
' Diagramme de sequence : Vote a une election presidentielle
' PARTIE 2/2 - 5 alts : Election non ouverte + Non eligible
'                    + Doublon + ADMIN + auth-service DOWN
' Scenario PFA - Ilyas Ait Maina (EMSI Maroc)
' Sources : code qui compile (election-service, auth-service)
' Regles : B.8.h (titulaire actif au moment du vote,
'                  ADMIN exempt, fail-closed si auth-service down)
' Flux vote global :
'   Cas nominal = sequence-vote-election.puml
'   5 alts (Election non ouverte + Non eligible + Doublon + ADMIN + auth-service DOWN)
'     = sequence-vote-election-failures.puml
' ============================================================

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FDF2F2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #B91C1C
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #D97706
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"

title Vote election - 5 alts (B.8.h) - non ouverte / non eligible / doublon / ADMIN / down

actor "Adherent\n(ADHERENT/PARENT)"   as U
actor "Admin"                            as ADM

boundary ":MesElectionsComponent\n(Angular)"      as FE
control  ":ApiService\n(Angular)"                  as API
control  ":ElectionService\n(@Transactional)"      as SVC
control  ":AuthSubscriptionClient\n(RestTemplate)"  as AUTHCLI
control  ":InternalMembershipController\n(auth-service)" as AUTHCTRL
entity   ":ElectionVoteRepository"                  as EVR
database "election_votes\n(UNIQUE election_id+user_id)" as DB

== Preambule : Cas nominal deja joue (sequence-vote-election.puml) ==
note over SVC
  Vient de : sequence-vote-election.puml
  - vote(electionId, candidateId) sur election OPEN
  - isActiveSubscriber(email) = true (ou ADMIN exempt)
  - findByElectionIdAndUserId = empty (1er vote)
  - INSERT election_votes OK
end note

== alt 1/5 : Election non ouverte ==
note over SVC
  status <> OPEN OU now<startsAt OU now>endsAt
  -> IllegalStateException ou IllegalArgumentException
end note
SVC --> CTRL : throw IllegalStateException
CTRL --> API : 400/409 {"message":"Cette election est cloturee"\n                        | "Le vote ouvre le ..."\n                        | "Le vote est clos depuis le ..."}
API --> FE : Observable.error
FE -> U : toast.error(message)

== alt 2/5 : Non eligible (pas d'abonnement ACTIF) ==
SVC -> AUTHCLI : isActiveSubscriber(email)
activate AUTHCLI
AUTHCLI -> AUTHCTRL : GET ...?email=...
AUTHCTRL --> AUTHCLI : {active:false}
AUTHCLI --> SVC : false
deactivate AUTHCLI
SVC --> CTRL : throw IllegalStateException("VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP")
note right of CTRL
  GlobalExceptionHandler intercepte
  le code AVANT le catch-all
  (sinon 409 Conflict generique)
end note
CTRL --> API : 403 Forbidden\n                {"code":"VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP",\n                 "message":"Pour voter... vous devez avoir\n                            une carte d'abonnement saisonnier active."}
API --> FE : Observable.error
FE -> FE : membershipRequiredMsg = err.error.message
FE -> U : affiche banniere + bouton "Acheter ma carte"
U -> FE : clic "Acheter ma carte"
FE -> U : router.navigate(['/abonnement'])

== alt 3/5 : Doublon (a deja vote) ==
U -> SVC : vote(electionId, candidateId)  ' 2eme tentative
activate SVC
SVC -> EVR : findByElectionIdAndUserId(electionId, userId)
activate EVR
EVR --> SVC : Optional<ElectionVote> present
deactivate EVR
SVC --> U : throw IllegalStateException("Vous avez deja vote pour cette election")
note right of SVC
  Front MesElectionsComponent :
  canVote=false apres le 1er vote,
  bouton "Voter" desactive ou cache
  -> 409 cote controleur (catch-all) ou 400
end note
SVC -> U : 409 Conflict {"message":"Vous avez deja vote pour cette election"}
deactivate SVC

== alt 4/5 : ADMIN (bypass complet) ==
ADM -> SVC : vote(electionId, candidateId)  ' avec role=ADMIN
activate SVC
note right of SVC
  Branche isActiveSubscriber()
  ENTIEREMENT sautee : ADMIN peut voter
  meme si auth-service est DOWN.
  Cf. opt [isAdmin() == false] sequence-vote-election.puml
end note
SVC -> EVR : findByElectionIdAndUserId(electionId, userId) -> empty
activate EVR
EVR --> SVC : empty
SVC -> EVR : save(ElectionVote)
EVR -> DB : INSERT INTO election_votes ...
activate DB
DB --> EVR : OK
deactivate DB
EVR --> SVC : ElectionVote persiste
deactivate EVR
SVC --> ADM : 200 OK ElectionView{myVoteIndex}
deactivate SVC

== alt 5/5 : auth-service DOWN (fail-closed B.8.h) ==
U -> SVC : vote(electionId, candidateId)  ' non-admin, pas ADMIN
activate SVC
SVC -> AUTHCLI : isActiveSubscriber(email)
activate AUTHCLI
AUTHCLI -> AUTHCTRL : GET /api/auth/internal/is-active-subscriber?email=...
activate AUTHCTRL
note right of AUTHCLI
  RestTemplate.exchange lance
  ResourceAccessException
  (timeout / connection refused)
end note
AUTHCTRL -[#red]x AUTHCLI : (timeout / connection refused)
deactivate AUTHCTRL
AUTHCLI -> AUTHCLI : catch (Exception)\nlog.warn(...)\nreturn false
AUTHCLI --> SVC : false
deactivate AUTHCLI
SVC --> U : throw IllegalStateException("VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP")
note right of SVC
  Regle B.8.h : "preferer un faux negatif
  (refus a tort) a un faux positif
  (vote valide sans verif)".
  Memoire : deploye 02/09/2026 (commit 98e0b09)
end note
SVC -> U : 403 Forbidden {code:"VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP"}
deactivate SVC
note over U
  Cote front : meme chemin que
  alt "Non eligible" -> banniere
  "Acheter ma carte" + lien /abonnement
end note

note over ADM, DB
  Garanties B.8.h etape 2/2 (5 alts) :
  --------------------------------------
  * Election non ouverte : 400/409 avec message contextuel
    ("cloturee" / "ouvre le ..." / "clos depuis ...")
  * Non eligible : 403 dedie VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP
    + banniere front + CTA /abonnement
  * Doublon : 409 dedie (UNIQUE election_id+user_id en BDD)
  * ADMIN : opt [isAdmin() == false] entierement saute,
    peut voter meme si abonnement down
  * Fail-closed : si auth-service DOWN ou timeout
    -> isActiveSubscriber() renvoie false
    -> 403 VOTE_REQUIRES_MEMBERSHIP (pas de bypass implicite)
  * Pas de bypass pour utilisateur non-admin :
    preferer refus a tort que vote non verifie
  * canVote=front reactive (mis a jour apres vote OK)
end note

@enduml
